// Slinger

@100 = ~Slinger~
@101 = ~Slinger~
@102 = ~SLINGER: Every halfling child learns the sling: for rabbits, for crows, for the occasional neighbour's window. The Slinger never stopped practising. A pouch of bullets and a leather cord are all they need to drop a charging orc at fifty paces, and by the time the giant works out where the stones are coming from, the small figure on the hill has already reloaded.

Advantages:
– Small and Nimble: +2 AC and +2 movement.
– May reach grandmastery in slings.
– +1 to hit and damage with slings at level 1, plus 1 more every 4 levels afterwards, with no cap.
– Rapid Sling: +1/2 attack per round with slings at levels 9, 18, 27 and 36.
– Called Shot: 1 use at level 4, plus 1 more every 4 levels afterwards.
  CALLED SHOT: For 1 round, every sling hit gives its target -1 to hit; from level 8 also -1 to saves vs spells; from 12, -1 Strength; from 16, +2 damage; from 20, knockback; from 24, -2 AC; from 28, slow for 1 round; from 32, -2 to all saves; from 36, +4 more damage; from 40, stun for 1 round.

Disadvantages:
– Cannot wear armour heavier than studded leather.
– May only use bucklers and small shields.
– Cannot use daggers, axes, two-handed weapons, or any ranged weapon except slings.
– Limited to proficiency (one slot) in all weapons other than slings.
– Requires Dexterity 16 or higher.
– Must be a halfling of good alignment.~

@110 = ~Slinger~
@111 = ~The Slinger's practised eye: +1 to hit and damage with slings.~
@112 = ~Small and Nimble~
@113 = ~+2 AC and +2 movement.~

@115 = ~Rapid Sling~
@116 = ~While the Slinger holds a sling, it gains +1/2 attack per round, rising to +2 by level 36.~

@120 = ~Called Shot~
@121 = ~Called Shot

For 1 round, every sling hit applies extra effects to its target for 1 turn: -1 to hit; from level 8 also -1 to saves vs spells; from 12, -1 Strength; from 16, +2 damage; from 20, knockback; from 24, -2 AC; from 28, slow for 1 round; from 32, -2 to all saves; from 36, +4 more damage; from 40, stun for 1 round.~

@130 = ~Dispelling Shot~
@131 = ~Dispelling Shot

When the party rests in a city, town or building (not a dungeon), once a day, the Slinger crafts 5 Dispelling bullets (+3) from a Moonstone Gem it carries. Each hit casts Dispel Magic on its target at the Slinger's level.~
@132 = ~Enhanced Dispelling~
@133 = ~Enhanced Dispelling

Requires Dispelling Shot. If the Slinger carries a Star Sapphire, it crafts 8 Enhanced Dispelling bullets instead. Their dispel always succeeds.~
@134 = ~Breaching Shot~
@135 = ~Breaching Shot

When the party rests in a city, town or building (not a dungeon), once a day, the Slinger crafts 5 Breaching bullets from a Bloodstone Gem it carries. They are not magical, so Protection from Magical Weapons can't stop them. Each hit casts Breach on its target.~
@136 = ~Enhanced Breaching~
@137 = ~Enhanced Breaching

Requires Breaching Shot. If the Slinger carries a Diamond, it crafts 8 Enhanced Breaching bullets instead, which also strip one spell protection per hit, as Secret Word.~
@138 = ~True Shot~
@139 = ~True Shot

When the party rests in a city, town or building (not a dungeon), once a day, the Slinger crafts 10 +4 sling bullets from a Sunstone Gem it carries.~
@140 = ~Enhanced True Shot~
@141 = ~Enhanced True Shot

Requires True Shot. If the Slinger carries an Emerald, it crafts 10 +5 sling bullets instead.~

@145 = ~Sure Aim~
@146 = ~Sure Aim

+1 use of Called Shot per day.~
@150 = ~Eagle Eye~
@151 = ~Eagle Eye

For 1 turn, +2 to hit and damage with slings, and each sling hit has a 25% chance to stun its target for 1 round (save vs spell negates).~
@155 = ~Out of Reach~
@156 = ~Out of Reach

For 1 turn, every round, enemies close to the Slinger must save vs breath or be knocked back.~
@160 = ~Gem Cutter's Eye~
@161 = ~Gem Cutter's Eye

Each time this ability is chosen, every batch of bullets the Slinger crafts has 2 more bullets.~

@170 = ~Dispelling Bullets~
@171 = ~Dispelling Bullets

A Slinger's bullet with a core of ground moonstone. Only a Slinger can use these bullets.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– +3 to hit and damage
– Each hit casts Dispel Magic on its target at the Slinger's level~
@172 = ~Enhanced Dispelling Bullets~
@173 = ~Enhanced Dispelling Bullets

A Slinger's bullet with a core of ground star sapphire. Only a Slinger can use these bullets.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– +3 to hit and damage
– Each hit dispels all magic on its target~
@174 = ~Breaching Bullets~
@175 = ~Breaching Bullets

A Slinger's bullet with a core of ground bloodstone. It is not magical, so Protection from Magical Weapons can't stop it. Only a Slinger can use these bullets.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Each hit casts Breach on its target~
@176 = ~Enhanced Breaching Bullets~
@177 = ~Enhanced Breaching Bullets

A Slinger's bullet with a core of ground diamond. It is not magical, so Protection from Magical Weapons can't stop it. Only a Slinger can use these bullets.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
– Each hit casts Breach on its target and strips one spell protection, as Secret Word~
@178 = ~True Shot Bullets +4~
@179 = ~True Shot Bullets +4

A Slinger's bullet with a core of ground sunstone. Only a Slinger can use these bullets.

